-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1tob2:"><div data-rid="c9d3c732-540d-4d90-9d3d-694246a6aa51" class="r-17xbhhq"><div data-rid="3f768d16-25cb-45a0-bf6d-e987f763a402" class="r-gd59x alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>"Why do I have to suffer from painful cramps every month?</strong>"<br><br>Period pain (dysmenorrhea), is normally caused by prostaglandins - hormone-like chemicals found all over the body. The prostaglandins in the female reproductive tract help to regulate ovulation, menstruation and labour.</p><p><br></p><p>Prostaglandins cause the muscles of the uterus to contract and this causes the pain you experience just before and during your period.</p><p><br></p><p>Those who have more prostaglandins usually experience more period pain. You can lower it by supporting your body with nutrient supplementation, diet and lifestyle changes; improving your period pain for good!<br><br><strong>What's making it worse?</strong></p><p><br></p><p>In today's world, we are faced with stress, hormone-disrupting chemicals, and nutrient depleted food - factors that contribute to hormonal imbalances causing period pain and related symptoms such as cramps, bloating, mood swings, low energy etc.</p><p><br></p><p>Painkillers offer temporary relief, but we believe women deserve better. That's why we created monthlies - a natural, long-term solution developed by five women's health experts. After helping over 2,500 women in their clinics, our experts formulated monthlies with 26 powerful ingredients to ease cramps, balance hormones and support your cycle - so you can feel your best, every month.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d17e9540-5bef-4223-bb1f-46800ff00ec7" class="r-1yi7rjx" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e7487795-433c-4394-96a5-afd2472352ea" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1usqb8i"><div data-rid="7b106d5f-87ac-49b6-8306-95339b48bf3d" class="r-m4z6g5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do I take it?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d7c0f9c9-3055-403a-bb69-86ef3c8d8459" class="r-2zzss1"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2tob2:"><div data-rid="8170825c-cd81-4046-b492-3efe46919007" class="r-kt9nct"><div data-rid="0240f41b-88bc-4308-8a3e-1dfe4081a0cd" class="r-19q0cxb alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Taking monthlies is simple and convenient. Add one scoop (7.4 grams) to 300 ml of water or your favourite beverage once a day.</p><p><br></p><p>For optimal results, we recommend taking it in the morning, ideally with food, as it can provide a gentle energy boost that supports you through your day.</p><p><br></p><p>Taking it daily can help build nutrient reserves in the body and deliver the best benefits across your cycle.<br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9f985a69-3b34-4d7f-9307-1217f2b0b5dd" class="r-hf9mnh" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="7b40ca63-a1e0-4dd9-b34c-c01ab7bdf9b9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-6j8r6k"><div data-rid="78cf3883-7a7c-4273-a5df-48f80b873c7b" class="r-1b530r3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What makes monthlies different?</p></span></div><div data-rid="e4df102f-59e8-4c42-a7a5-5af1dffe7ea2" class="r-1ctxnnp"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3tob2:"><div data-rid="5aa60860-b409-4215-a83f-0d2c053aca47" class="r-19unt7l"><div data-rid="bc814966-5256-48b5-be40-d016e9da3fa3" class="r-knij6s alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Women of reproductive age often need a range of essential nutrients to maintain hormonal balance and general wellness, yet clinical data shows that many adult women are deficient in key nutrients like Folate, Choline, Vitamin D and Iron. monthlies not only helps replenish these critical nutrients but also includes a blend of clinically backed ingredients in highly absorbable forms.</p><p><br></p><ul><li><p><strong>All you need:</strong> 26+ ingredients combined in 1 scoop per day, so no need to invest in multiple supplements for the same benefits.</p></li><li><p><strong>Highly absorbable ingredients: </strong>monthlies offers vitamins like Folate, B6 and B12 in their active (methylated) forms for superior absorption and quality.</p></li><li><p><strong>Superior sourcing:</strong> We have partnered with UK labs that have transparent and trusted sourcing.</p></li></ul><p><strong>CGMP Certified: </strong>We only work with CGMP certified suppliers and manufacturers.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="68628f43-932f-4648-b439-e81facca0ddb" class="r-werf0b" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="875678a0-319a-4c6f-ac3e-da2625ec4606" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R4tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1lfx6rj"><div data-rid="19e90979-e975-492f-aeab-7f9414e6b48c" class="r-1m42k6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How does the formula work?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d35176bc-ef60-45fb-af93-5ce99b372c14" class="r-1x7p50w"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R4tob2:"><div data-rid="78819140-7b34-4eca-948f-e50365c8684b" class="r-18d3mg1"><div data-rid="7328968f-548b-4efa-b59a-d6d890d6f333" class="r-1m730py alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>monthlies works from within, replenishing essential nutrients with highly absorbable ingredients so your body can use them to the fullest. <br><br>It includes <strong>key vitamins, nutrients and plant extracts that support natural processes to tackle inflammation, optimise hormone metabolism, and promote efficient hormone elimination.*</strong></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="dd9499a5-dbc8-4c8e-9779-92736d55ecf1" class="r-1tgtn58" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0a7c5d89-e8b9-4ed4-95df-2594cec14f15" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1xiuz7v"><div data-rid="2e419d11-5981-4f2c-bc3c-1667b8db7c37" class="r-4rzadd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Benefits</p></span></div><div data-rid="cd4f5752-241d-4f6b-ba3e-314be8c9e6aa" class="r-livnm4"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5tob2:"><div data-rid="eadf6468-cada-4b5a-9b46-f59710678535" class="r-196rji"><div data-rid="de2c73c1-72ca-4c9d-9ad1-ceb715329a0e" class="r-hfdmla alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We recognise that the menstrual cycle affects much more than just period pain. It influences everything from sleep and digestion to mood, energy and skin. That's why we created a product that not only helps with menstrual symptoms but also supports your body's natural processes, reduced period discomfort, and enhances overall health. <br><br>Here are some key benefits:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Hormone Support:</strong> Vitamin B</p></li><li><p><strong>Energy Production:</strong> Magnesium, Vitamin B</p></li><li><p><strong>Mood:</strong> Lemon Balm, Vitamin B6</p></li><li><p><strong>Digestion:</strong> Aniseed</p></li><li><p><strong>Sleep:</strong> Lemon Balm</p></li><li><p><strong>Blood Sugar Support:</strong> Chromium</p></li><li><p><strong>Skin, Hair and Nails</strong>: Vitamin A, B, C, Biotin and Zinc</p></li><li><p><strong>Immune Health:</strong> Vitamin A, C, Selenium and Zinc</p></li></ul></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0ad5a01a-a692-4355-8aa4-ef09373c8c47" class="r-1ek624s" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="66b4cedd-9469-40fc-83f2-13ddae569a24" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R6tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1inx942"><div data-rid="54bca564-4296-4cc4-9e26-612b890cd35f" class="r-1cm9ufm alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Ingredients</p></span></div><div data-rid="9c6b3d14-a555-4774-9e3d-981c2be89faf" class="r-y7qto3"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-li